# The planning map's right-click menu, contextMenuStrip1: it opens on the right button, a click
# off it closes it without adding a waypoint, and the coverage table's counts are published.
#
# The claims a screenshot cannot make: the menu is open or closed, the press that closed it added
# nothing to the mission, and the counts the application reports are the table's.

screen plan
window 1600x1200
settle 4

expect coverage.flightplanner.total 121
expect coverage.flightplanner.done 82
expect coverage.flightplanner.missing 27
expect plan.menu closed

# The right button opens the menu, as MainMap.ContextMenuStrip does, and adds nothing.
click map@0.30x0.40:right
expect plan.menu open
expect plan.menu.submenu none
expect mission.items 0

# A drop-down opens from its entry.
click menu-loiter
expect plan.menu.submenu menu-loiter

# A click off the menu closes it and is not also a click that adds a waypoint.
click map@0.70x0.20
expect plan.menu closed
expect mission.items 0

# The next click on the map is an ordinary one again.
click map@0.70x0.20
expect mission.items 1
